# 1. Check Storage

### List disks and partitions

```bash
lsblk
```

### Check filesystem usage

```bash
df -h
```

### Display Physical Volumes

```bash
pvs
```

### Display Volume Groups

```bash
vgs
```

### Display Logical Volumes

```bash
